{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a3f1c8e2-6b4d-4e2a-9c1a-7f2d5b9e0c11",
    "name": "Previred - Personas API",
    "description": "Coleccion para validar el CRUD de personas del Desafio Tecnico Previred 2025.\n\nEstructura:\n- 01 - CRUD feliz: flujo completo crear/listar/obtener/actualizar/eliminar.\n- 02 - Validaciones: RUT invalido, campos obligatorios, fecha futura, RUT duplicado, inmutabilidad del RUT, 404.\n- 03 - Contingencia (manual): requiere detener/reiniciar SQL Server a mano (docker compose stop/start sqlserver) para verificar el mecanismo de resiliencia (outbox + reconciliacion).\n\nCada carpeta limpia (elimina) los registros que crea, por lo que la coleccion es re-ejecutable de punta a punta con el Collection Runner.\n\nRequiere el backend corriendo en {{baseUrl}} (por defecto http://localhost:8080) y SQL Server levantado (docker compose up -d sqlserver (y luego: docker compose up sqlserver-init, una sola vez)) salvo en la carpeta de contingencia.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rutCrud", "value": "12345678-5", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rutDuplicado", "value": "76086428-5", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rutInmutable", "value": "11111111-1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rutSinExistir", "value": "22222222-2", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rutFormatoInvalido", "value": "11.111.111-2", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rutContingencia", "value": "5-1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - CRUD feliz",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear persona",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"rut\": \"{{rutCrud}}\",\n    \"nombre\": \"Juan\",\n    \"apellido\": \"Perez\",\n    \"fechaNacimiento\": \"1990-01-01\",\n    \"direccion\": {\n        \"calle\": \"Av. Siempre Viva 742\",\n        \"comuna\": \"Providencia\",\n        \"region\": \"Metropolitana\"\n    }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/personas",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "personas"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('El rut coincide (normalizado)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.rut).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('rutCrud'));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Queda SINCRONIZADO (SQL Server disponible)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.estadoSincronizacion).to.eql('SINCRONIZADO');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('La edad viene calculada', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.edad).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.edad).to.be.at.least(0);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
